message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
title: "Accurate 3D Maize Ear Phenotyping Using Voxel Grids Derived from RGB Machine Vision"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: "https://github.com/DerOehmer/maize-ear-voxel-phenotyping"

